                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Tomakeŋ akuan kere kerucokin ka ainicakinio ejok kanuka aisigalikin naka ŋinikilenyasit, kwape ejaar aswam kotoma aitemis naka ŋinitutubet, kiyatanakini akuan apoloor kanuka aiduk kotoma aminanar.",
